# Credential material must never be committed. This repo synchronizes secrets,
# so its tests and docs are dense with secret-shaped placeholders; these guards
# keep a real credential from slipping in alongside them unnoticed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
credentials.json
